# Natural Yakuman ignores regular yaku and dora (even with many dora)
# (rules.md §4 item 34).
# Seat 0 makes two closed kans. Indicators 5z, 6z and 7z make all nine
# dragons in seat 1's hand dora. Seat 1 has the red 5m as well.
# Seat 0 discards 8p, completing seat 1's pair for Daisangen.
# Scoring for Seat 1 (non-dealer, South):
#   Natural Yakuman: daisangen:1 ONLY (1x Yakuman = 32000 from Seat 0; all 10 dora ignored!).

[meta]
